
@startuml
title 酒店预订系统——顺序图4：顾客退房

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #000000
    ParticipantBorderColor #1F2D3D
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantFontColor #0000CC
    ParticipantFontSize 16
    LifeLineBorderColor #1F2D3D
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    MessageFontColor #0000CC
    MessageFontSize 13
}
<style>
participant {
    Padding 28
}
</style>
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

hide footbox

actor "顾客" as Customer
actor "酒店工作人员" as Staff
participant ":酒店工作人员界面" as UI
participant ":预订订单管理" as Booking
participant ":预订订单" as Order
participant ":入住登记" as CheckIn
participant ":操作日志" as Log

Customer -> Staff : 提出退房请求并提供订单号
Staff -> UI : 查询订单并办理退房
UI -> Booking : 查询订单及当前状态
Booking -> Order : 查询订单状态
Order --> Booking : 返回订单信息
Booking --> UI : 返回订单详情

Staff -> UI : 核对信息并确认退房
UI -> Booking : 提交退房操作
Booking -> Order : 再次校验订单状态
Order --> Booking : 返回已入住状态

Booking -> CheckIn : 更新实际退房登记时间
CheckIn --> Booking : 返回登记成功

Booking -> Order : 将订单状态更新为已退房
Order --> Booking : 返回状态更新结果

Booking -> Log : 记录退房时间及操作人
Log --> Booking : 返回记录成功

Booking --> UI : 返回退房办理成功
UI --> Staff : 显示办理结果
Staff -> Customer : 确认退房完成

@enduml
